# ============================================================
# Project — project-level management.
# Docs: https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/api
# ============================================================


### List projects
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/project

### Update project
PATCH {{BASE_URL}}/api/project/{{projectID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My project",
  "path": "/path/to/project"
}

### Get current project
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/project/current
